  "rule": "First replace every control character (U+0000 to U+001F and U+007F to U+009F) with a space. Then, when the text has more than 500 Unicode code points (not UTF-16 units or bytes), keep its first 499 and append U+2026, for 500 in all. Hide a notice when one with the same level and the same shown text was shown less than 10000 ms earlier; a hidden notice does not restart the window.",
